              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Manje thumela futhi uqoqe izinkomo zakho nakho konke onakho endle; ngoba phezu kwawo wonke umuntu nezilwane ezitholakala endle futhi zingalethwa ekhaya, isichotho siyowela phezu kwazo, zife.",
