              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "INkosi yasisithi kuMozisi: Yelulela isandla sakho emazulwini, ukuze kube khona isichotho elizweni lonke leGibhithe, phezu kwabantu lezilwane laphezu kwazo zonke izimila zeganga elizweni lonke leGibhithe.",
