              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwasekusiba khona isichotho lomlilo kuxutshaniswe lesiqhotho, esinzima kakhulu, ekungazange kube khona okunjengalokhu elizweni lonke leGibhithe selokhu laba yisizwe.",
